# Copy to .env for `npm run dev`; never commit .env.
#
# The site's own Petiole API key, used for a request that brings none, so
# visitors are not asked for theirs. For a private site only: every visitor
# spends it. On Netlify, set it in the site's environment variables instead.
# Make it on Keys & access in the Petiole platform, with the Leaf area
# workflow and an expiry. Leave it empty to have each visitor enter their own.
PETIOLE_API_KEY=
